{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-74","timestamp_unix_ms":1747459396405,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I had not been long in Hertfordshire before I saw, in common with others, that Bingley preferred your elder sister to any other young woman in the country.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-75","timestamp_unix_ms":1747461029405,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+13136168017","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"They followed her into the dining-parlour.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-76","timestamp_unix_ms":1747463582405,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"where is your sash, my dear? so genteel and so easy!","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-77","timestamp_unix_ms":1747473768405,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Indeed, Eliza, you will be as welcome to me as either of them.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-78","timestamp_unix_ms":1747479092405,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+13136168017","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Do not consider me now as an elegant female intending to plague you, but as a rational creature speaking the truth from her heart.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-79","timestamp_unix_ms":1747482179405,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Bingley was good-looking and gentlemanlike: he had a pleasant countenance, and easy, unaffected manners.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-80","timestamp_unix_ms":1747485246405,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"It was spoken of again while they were at dinner, when Mr.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-81","timestamp_unix_ms":1747486540405,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+13136168017","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"You have a sweet room here, Mr. Collins was wishing to marry you.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-82","timestamp_unix_ms":1747486559405,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"How little did you tell me of what passed at Pemberley and Lambton! Hurst, principally occupied in playing with her bracelets and rings, joined now and then in her brother's conversation with Miss Bennet.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-83","timestamp_unix_ms":1747489125405,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Nay, when I read a letter of his, I cannot help giving him the preference even over Wickham, much as I value the impudence and hypocrisy of my son-in-law.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-84","timestamp_unix_ms":1747491468405,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+13136168017","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Bingley was everything that was charming, except the professed lover of her daughter.","attachments":[{"path":"attachments/receipt.jpg","original_name":"Scan_2024-03-15.jpg","mime_type":"image/jpeg","digest_sha256":"b253ee4835590df05a95c9e23b2c84c2bcbcd07ac91b0a0240ee9c7c42133273","is_sticker":false,"transcription":null,"sticker_effect":null,"size_bytes":2806}],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-85","timestamp_unix_ms":1747492291405,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"The chief of every day was spent by him at Lucas Lodge, and he sometimes returned to Longbourn only in time to make an apology for his absence before the family went to bed.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-86","timestamp_unix_ms":1747496247405,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"It was an earnest, steadfast gaze, but she often doubted whether there were much admiration in it, and sometimes it seemed nothing but absence of mind.  \"Yes, there can; for mine is totally different.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-87","timestamp_unix_ms":1747496742405,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+13136168017","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"","attachments":[{"path":"attachments/sunset.jpg","original_name":"IMG_2847.jpg","mime_type":"image/jpeg","digest_sha256":"f6b85d9141f3c54a373d06dc2f527d31560ea7be01ea18255b7c45985699062f","is_sticker":false,"transcription":null,"sticker_effect":null,"size_bytes":2736}],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-88","timestamp_unix_ms":1748834185405,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Darcy took her advice, and did finish his letter.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-89","timestamp_unix_ms":1748844859405,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"You deserve no such attention.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+13136168017-90","timestamp_unix_ms":1748847625405,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+13136168017","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"But does not Jane correspond with his sister?","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
